### Create a new todo

POST {{baseUrl}}/todos
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
"title" : "Test2",
"description" : "THis is test2"
}

### Get all todos

GET {{baseUrl}}/todos
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}


### Edit a todo

PUT {{baseUrl}}/todos/3
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

{
"description" :"",
"title" : "Editted title"
}

